"MealMirror is designed to review meal carbohydrates without an account or a developer-operated server. This policy describes the data handled by this version of the app." = "MealMirror 旨在在没有账户或开发者运营服务器的情况下审查餐食碳水化合物。此政策描述了该版本应用处理的数据。";
