"MealMirror is not intended to diagnose, monitor, prevent, or treat a condition, provide emergency services, or replace professional advice. The App Store build does not calculate insulin units, correction doses, or treatment actions." = "MealMirror 不用于诊断、监测、预防或治疗任何疾病，也不提供紧急服务或替代专业建议。App Store 版本不计算胰岛素单位、矫正剂量或治疗操作。";
"MealMirror makes no requests to a developer-operated server." = "MealMirror 不会向开发者运营的服务器发送任何请求。";
"MealMirror organizes user-described meal items, shows inspectable local reference ranges, preserves uncertainty, and lets you replace an estimate with a trusted label value." = "MealMirror 组织用户描述的餐食项目，显示可检查的本地参考范围，保留不确定性，并允许您用可信标签值替换估算值。";
